---
name: summarize-input
description: What the summarising model is given - the summary so far, if any, and the messages to fold into it.
template:
  format:
    kind: mustache
  parser:
    kind: prompty
inputs:
  previous:
    kind: string
    description: "the summary written on an earlier turn (empty the first time)"
    example: ""
  transcript:
    kind: string
    description: "the messages leaving the window, \"User: …\" and \"Assistant: …\""
    example: "User: Plan my week.\nAssistant: Taxes on Monday, the dentist on Wednesday."
---
{{#previous}}
Summary so far:
{{previous}}

Continue it with these later messages:
{{/previous}}
{{^previous}}
Summarise these messages:
{{/previous}}

{{transcript}}
